  "title": "Fibre-optics / telecom chain",
  "h1": "Germanium in optical fibre and the suppliers of submarine cables",
  "deck": "Standard optical fibre has a germanium-doped core. The quantity is small and known only from estimates. Fibre for the longest submarine cables is offered with a pure silica core. Four suppliers built 83% of submarine cable length between 2020 and 2024.",
